        <activityName xml:lang="en">Triethylene glycol, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Triethylene glycol, at plant
This Multi-Output inventory is based on literature sources that are based on actual plant throughputs and measurements. The oxidation of ethylene oxide leads to three coproducts: ethylene glycol, diethylene glycol (DEG) and triethylene glycol (TEG).;
UUID: 2ba86a05-e5a3-373d-ac26-6da95ad62daf
includes precursors, transports and infrastructure
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: represents a current cross-section of actual plants in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2ba86a05-e5a3-373d-ac26-6da95ad62daf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
